{
  "model": "gpt-5-2",
  "openapi": {
    "openapi": "3.1.0",
    "info": {
      "title": "kie.ai",
      "description": "kie.ai API 文档",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "contact": {
        "name": "技术支持",
        "email": "support@kie.ai"
      }
    },
    "tags": [],
    "paths": {
      "/gpt-5-2/v1/chat/completions": {
        "post": {
          "summary": "GPT 5.2",
          "deprecated": false,
          "description": ":::warning\n**⚠️ Chat only**\n\nThis model currently supports chat requests only and has not yet been adapted for agent use. Connecting it to an agent may cause request errors or unexpected results.\n:::\n\n> GPT-5-2 API is a next-generation multimodal model with exceptional reasoning capabilities, supporting text and image inputs with Web Search grounding and adjustable reasoning effort.\n\n<CardGroup cols={2}>\n  <Card title=\"Multimodal\" icon=\"lucide-image\">\n    Supports text and image inputs\n  </Card>\n  <Card title=\"Real-time Search\" icon=\"lucide-search\">\n    Web search grounding enabled\n  </Card>\n  <Card title=\"Reasoning Effort\" icon=\"lucide-list-minus\">\n    Adjustable reasoning effort level\n  </Card>\n  <Card title=\"Flexible Roles\" icon=\"lucide-users\">\n    Multiple message roles supported\n  </Card>\n</CardGroup>\n\n## Unified Media File Format\n\n:::caution\n\nIn the `messages` parameter's `content` array, only images are supported. All image files use the same format structure:\n\n- The `type` field is always `\"image_url\"`\n- The `image_url` field name remains unchanged\n- The only thing that changes is the `url` value, which points to the corresponding image address\n\nFor example: `{ type: 'image_url', image_url: { url: '...' } }` structure.\n\n:::\n\n## Tools Parameter\n\nThe `tools` parameter is an optional array that allows you to enable Web Search grounding.\n\n### Web Search\n\nUse this format to enable Web Search grounding:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"function\",\n  \"function\": {\n    \"name\": \"web_search\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThis enables real-time information retrieval via Web Search.\n\n## Response Example\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"chatcmpl-example-123\",\n  \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\n  \"created\": 1741569952,\n  \"model\": \"gpt-5-2\",\n  \"choices\": [\n    {\n      \"index\": 0,\n      \"message\": {\n        \"role\": \"assistant\",\n        \"content\": \"hello,can i help you?\",\n        \"refusal\": null,\n        \"annotations\": []\n      },\n      \"logprobs\": null,\n      \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"usage\": {\n    \"prompt_tokens\": 10,\n    \"completion_tokens\": 50,\n    \"total_tokens\": 60\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Error handling\n\nCheck the response body, not only the HTTP status. Errors are returned either as `{\"code\": ..., \"msg\": \"...\"}` (for example 401 invalid API key, 402 insufficient credits, 429 rate limited; the HTTP status may still be 200) or as `{\"error\": {\"type\": \"...\", \"message\": \"...\"}}`.\n",
          "operationId": "gpt-5-2-chat-completions",
          "tags": [],
          "parameters": [],
          "requestBody": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "messages": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "description": "An array of message objects. Each message has a role and content.\n\n**Unified Media File Format:**\n\nIn the content array, only images are supported. All image files use the same format structure:\n\n- The `type` field is always `\"image_url\"`\n- The `image_url` field name remains unchanged\n- The only thing that changes is the `url` value, which points to the corresponding image address\n\nFor example: `{ type: 'image_url', image_url: { url: '...' } }` structure.",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "role": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                              "developer",
                              "system",
                              "user",
                              "assistant"
                            ],
                            "description": "Message role\n\n- **developer**: Developer-provided instructions that the model should follow, regardless of user messages. In o1 models and newer versions, developer messages replace the previous system messages.\n- **system**: Developer-provided instructions that the model should follow, regardless of user messages. In o1 models and newer versions, please use developer messages instead.\n- **user**: Messages sent by end users, containing prompts or additional context information.\n- **assistant**: Messages sent by the model in response to user messages."
                          },
                          "content": {
                            "type": "array",
                            "description": "Text and image parts only.",
                            "items": {
                              "oneOf": [
                                {
                                  "type": "object",
                                  "properties": {
                                    "type": {
                                      "type": "string",
                                      "enum": [
                                        "text"
                                      ],
                                      "examples": [
                                        "text"
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    "text": {
                                      "type": "string",
                                      "description": "Text content of the message."
                                    }
                                  },
                                  "required": [
                                    "type",
                                    "text"
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "object",
                                  "properties": {
                                    "type": {
                                      "type": "string",
                                      "enum": [
                                        "image_url"
                                      ],
                                      "examples": [
                                        "image_url"
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    "image_url": {
                                      "type": "object",
                                      "properties": {
                                        "url": {
                                          "type": "string",
                                          "format": "uri",
                                          "description": "URL of the image."
                                        }
                                      },
                                      "required": [
                                        "url"
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  },
                                  "required": [
                                    "type",
                                    "image_url"
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "role",
                          "content"
                        ]
                      },
                      "minItems": 1
                    },
                    "tools": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "description": "An optional array of tools the model may call. Supports Web Search: `{\"type\": \"function\", \"function\": {\"name\": \"web_search\"}}` - Enables real-time information retrieval via Web Search.",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "description": "Only the built-in web search is supported: {\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"web_search\"}}.",
                        "properties": {
                          "type": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                              "function"
                            ],
                            "description": "Must be `function`.",
                            "examples": [
                              "function"
                            ]
                          },
                          "function": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "properties": {
                              "name": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "enum": [
                                  "web_search"
                                ],
                                "description": "Must be `web_search`.",
                                "examples": [
                                  "web_search"
                                ]
                              }
                            },
                            "required": [
                              "name"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "type",
                          "function"
                        ]
                      },
                      "minItems": 0
                    },
                    "reasoning_effort": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "low",
                        "high"
                      ],
                      "description": "The effort level for the model to use for reasoning. Low effort is faster to respond, high effort is slower to respond but solves more complex problems. Default is \"high\".",
                      "default": "high"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "messages"
                  ],
                  "examples": [
                    {
                      "messages": [
                        {
                          "role": "user",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "What is in this image?"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "image_url",
                              "image_url": {
                                "url": "https://file.aiquickdraw.com/custom-page/akr/section-images/1759055072437dqlsclj2.png"
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ],
                      "tools": [
                        {
                          "type": "function",
                          "function": {
                            "name": "web_search"
                          }
                        }
                      ],
                      "reasoning_effort": "high"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "messages": [
                    {
                      "role": "user",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "What is in this image?"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "image_url",
                          "image_url": {
                            "url": "https://file.aiquickdraw.com/custom-page/akr/section-images/1759055072437dqlsclj2.png"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "tools": [
                    {
                      "type": "function",
                      "function": {
                        "name": "web_search"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "reasoning_effort": "high"
                }
              }
            },
            "required": true
          },
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "description": "Request successful. Returns the standard chat completion format.",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Unique identifier for the chat completion",
                        "examples": [
                          "chatcmpl-example-123"
                        ]
                      },
                      "object": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Object type",
                        "examples": [
                          "chat.completion"
                        ]
                      },
                      "created": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "format": "int64",
                        "description": "Unix timestamp of when the completion was created",
                        "examples": [
                          1677652288
                        ]
                      },
                      "model": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Model name",
                        "examples": [
                          "gpt-5-2"
                        ]
                      },
                      "choices": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "description": "Array of completion choices",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "index": {
                              "type": "integer",
                              "description": "Index of the choice",
                              "examples": [
                                0
                              ]
                            },
                            "message": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "properties": {
                                "role": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "examples": [
                                    "assistant"
                                  ]
                                },
                                "content": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "description": "Message content"
                                }
                              },
                              "required": [
                                "role",
                                "content"
                              ]
                            },
                            "finish_reason": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "Reason why the completion finished",
                              "examples": [
                                "stop"
                              ]
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "index",
                            "message",
                            "finish_reason"
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "usage": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "prompt_tokens": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "description": "Number of tokens in the prompt",
                            "examples": [
                              10
                            ]
                          },
                          "completion_tokens": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "description": "Number of tokens in the completion",
                            "examples": [
                              50
                            ]
                          },
                          "total_tokens": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "description": "Total number of tokens",
                            "examples": [
                              60
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "prompt_tokens",
                          "completion_tokens",
                          "total_tokens"
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "headers": {}
            },
            "400": {
              "description": "Bad Request - Invalid request parameters",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "message": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "examples": [
                              "Invalid request parameters"
                            ]
                          },
                          "type": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "examples": [
                              "invalid_request_error"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "headers": {}
            },
            "401": {
              "description": "Unauthorized - Invalid or missing API key",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "message": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "examples": [
                              "Unauthorized"
                            ]
                          },
                          "type": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "examples": [
                              "authentication_error"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "headers": {}
            },
            "429": {
              "description": "Rate Limited - Too many requests",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "message": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "examples": [
                              "Rate limit exceeded"
                            ]
                          },
                          "type": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "examples": [
                              "rate_limit_error"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "headers": {}
            },
            "500": {
              "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error",
              "description": "Server error."
            }
          },
          "security": [
            {
              "BearerAuth": []
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "webhooks": {},
    "components": {
      "schemas": {},
      "responses": {
        "Error": {
          "description": "Server error.",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "code": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "description": "Response status code\n\n- **200**: Success - Request has been processed successfully\n- **401**: Unauthorized - Authentication credentials are missing or invalid\n- **402**: Insufficient Credits - Account does not have enough credits to perform the operation\n- **404**: Not Found - The requested resource or endpoint does not exist\n- **408**: Timeout - No result has been returned for over 10 minutes.\n- **422**: Validation Error - The request parameters failed validation checks\n- **429**: Rate Limited - Request limit has been exceeded for this resource\n- **455**: Service Unavailable - System is currently undergoing maintenance\n- **500**: Server Error - An unexpected error occurred while processing the request\n- **501**: Generation Failed - Content generation task failed\n- **505**: Feature Disabled - The requested feature is currently disabled"
                  },
                  "msg": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Response message, error description when failed"
                  },
                  "data": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {}
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "code",
                  "msg",
                  "data"
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "Example 1": {
                  "summary": "Example 1",
                  "value": {
                    "code": 500,
                    "msg": "Server Error - An unexpected error occurred while processing the request"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "securitySchemes": {
        "BearerAuth": {
          "type": "http",
          "scheme": "bearer",
          "bearerFormat": "API Key",
          "description": "All API requests require a Bearer Token. Add the header `Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY` to authenticate requests."
        }
      }
    },
    "servers": [
      {
        "url": "https://api.kie.ai",
        "description": "正式环境"
      }
    ],
    "security": [
      {
        "BearerAuth": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
